## Third-party notices

This repository integrates with, but does not redistribute, the following
components. Each carries its own licence:

- **9Router** (Apache-2.0) — https://github.com/decolua/9router
- **Wikidepia/indonesian-tts** (VITS fine-tune) — CC BY-NC 4.0 style
  restriction: **DO NOT USE FOR COMMERCIAL PURPOSES**. See
  https://github.com/Wikidepia/indonesian-tts for upstream terms.
  This project downloads the model files at install time; none are
  redistributed here.
- **openai/whisper-large-v3** — MIT (model card), Apache-2.0 (code).
  Model weights are pulled from HuggingFace on first use.
- **Inter** and **JetBrains Mono** fonts — SIL Open Font Licence 1.1,
  loaded at runtime from Google Fonts.
- **VoltAgent/awesome-design-md** — MIT. Design tokens in `DESIGN.md`
  adapted from the Linear and ElevenLabs entries; see that repo for
  attribution to the original sites.
